---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="About — KMA Kickstart Marketing Agency">
  <div class="wrap">
    <section>
      <div class="eyebrow">The band bio</div>
      <h2>From the stage to <span class="g">the strategy.</span></h2>
      <div class="two" style="margin-top:36px">
        <div>
          <p class="sub" style="margin-bottom:18px">Kickstart Marketing Agency (KMA) is a results-driven digital marketing agency helping businesses, startups, sports organizations, and personal brands grow. We combine creativity, technology, and data-driven insight to build awareness, generate quality leads, and drive measurable growth.</p>
          <p class="sub">Our CEO spent years as a working musician before founding KMA. Every show taught the same lesson great marketing needs: know your audience, command the room, and leave them wanting an encore. We don't just market businesses — we build brands people trust.</p>
          <ul class="why">
            <li>Creative solutions, results-driven strategy</li>
            <li>Affordable pricing &amp; fast delivery</li>
            <li>Client-focused, professional team</li>
            <li>Innovative marketing, every campaign</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="amp-card"><h3>Mission</h3><p>To empower businesses with creative marketing solutions that deliver measurable growth and long-term success.</p></div>
          <div class="amp-card"><h3>Vision</h3><p>To become Africa's leading marketing agency, recognized for innovation, creativity, and exceptional results.</p></div>
          <div class="amp-card"><h3>Venues we play</h3><p>Football clubs &amp; academies · Startups · Schools · NGOs · Events · Personal brands · E-commerce</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
